           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "•PE: Kussmaul respirations · hyperpnea/hypervent (resp compensation for acidosis) · tachy · ↓skin turgor · dry mucous membranes · poor perf · drowsiness"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
