           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "•AG = Na − (Cl + HCO3) - est ketosis/acidosis severity (↑AG = ↑ketosis) - mean AG in children w DKA ~30mmol/L - AG 14 = norm in children"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
